{
  "id": "read-dashboard-panels-find-queries",
  "title": "Find queries and data sources",
  "blocks": [
    { "type": "markdown", "content": "You'll inspect two queries that supply data to the same panel without changing their expressions." },
    { "type": "section", "id": "inspect-queries", "title": "Find the panel's data sources", "blocks": [
      { "type": "interactive", "action": "navigate", "reftarget": "/d/000000100/mixed-datasources?from=now-24h&to=now&timezone=browser", "verify": "on-page:/d/000000100", "content": "Open the **Mixed Datasources** dashboard." },
      { "type": "interactive", "action": "highlight", "reftarget": "[data-viz-panel-key='panel-1'] button[data-testid='data-testid Panel menu Prometheus and Loki']", "requirements": ["on-page:/d/000000100", "exists-reftarget"], "doIt": false, "tooltip": "Click here to open the panel menu, then select Edit.", "content": "Open the **Prometheus and Loki** panel menu and select **Edit**. Select query **A** if it isn't already selected." },
      { "type": "interactive", "action": "highlight", "reftarget": "input[data-testid='data-testid Select a data source']", "requirements": ["on-page:/d/000000100", "exists-reftarget"], "doIt": false, "content": "Notice the Prometheus data source for query **A**." },
      { "type": "markdown", "content": "Query **A** gets metrics from Prometheus. The data source tells you where Grafana sends the query; the query selects and summarizes data for the panel." },
      { "type": "interactive", "action": "button", "reftarget": "[role='button'][aria-label='Select card C']", "requirements": ["on-page:/d/000000100", "exists-reftarget"], "doIt": true, "content": "Select query **C** to inspect the panel's second query." },
      { "type": "interactive", "action": "highlight", "reftarget": "input[data-testid='data-testid Select a data source']", "requirements": ["on-page:/d/000000100", "exists-reftarget"], "doIt": false, "content": "Notice the Loki data source for query **C**." },
      { "type": "markdown", "content": "Query **C** gets logs from Grafana Loki and calculates values from them. The panel's **Mixed** data source lets its queries use different sources. The panel displays results from both queries." },
      { "type": "markdown", "content": "A query's result format doesn't lock it to one visualization. Timestamped numeric samples can form a time-series graph or supply a summary value to a stat or gauge. Choose the display for the question, then make sure the query returns the fields it needs." },
      { "type": "interactive", "action": "navigate", "reftarget": "/d/000000100/mixed-datasources?viewPanel=1&from=now-24h&to=now&timezone=browser", "verify": "on-page:/d/000000100", "content": "Return to the panel without saving editor changes." }
    ] },
    { "type": "markdown", "content": "You've found a panel's queries and traced each one to its data source. The visualization presents their results; it doesn't define where the data comes from." }
  ]
}